# Fakr-Updatr example configuration file (available at <https://github.com/fakerhog15/fakr-updatr/blob/main/res/config/fakr-updatr.conf.example>).
# Documentation for this configuration file is available in the fakr-updatr.conf(5) man page (see <https://github.com/fakerhog15/fakr-updatr/blob/main/doc/man/fakr-updatr.conf.5.scd>).
# List of available options (with their default value) below, un-comment one to enable it.

#NoColor
#NoVersion
#NoFlatpak
#NoNotification
#UpdateCheckTimeout=30
#PrivilegeElevationCommand=sudo
#ShowTrayWhenRelevant
#TrayUpdatesPerPage=0
#TrayIconStyle=blue
#ColorblindMode
